BT 1 0 0 1 0 30.3 Tm /F3 10.2 Tf 13.5 TL .5507 Tw (ZOMBIE RUNNER SUBWAY TUNNEL is a 3D survival horror endless runner made in Unity 6. The player takes the) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.081087 Tw (role of an armed survivor running through abandoned city streets and subway tunnels. The game combines three-lane) Tj T* 0 Tw (movement and obstacle avoidance with zombie pursuit, firearm combat, collectible resources, and horror atmosphere.) Tj T* ET
